  "title": "Good news for corporate and transaction banks: Corporates are turning away from non-banks",
  "summary": "Despite the market hype that FinTechs and other non-banks are encroaching on the market share of banks, this is not the case within the corporate and transaction banking market. There has been an 83% drop in non-bank usage among corporates in the past year, according to our latest sponsored survey with GTNews.",
